 14
Using MERGE statement insert and update EMP2 using EMP.
(MERGE Statement)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> MERGE INTO EMP2 E2
     USING EMP E
     ON (E2.EMPNO = E.EMPNO)

     WHEN MATCHED THEN
     UPDATE SET
     E2.ENAME = E.ENAME,
     E2.SAL   = E.SAL

     WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
     INSERT (EMPNO,ENAME,SAL)
     VALUES(E.EMPNO,E.ENAME,E.SAL);

Output:
-------

14 rows merged.


