 22
From WIPRO user delete all the employees from SCOTT.EMP
table in DEPTNO=10. What happens and Why?
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> DELETE FROM SCOTT.EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO=10;

Output:
-------

ORA-00054: resource busy and acquire with NOWAIT specified
or timeout expired.

Reason:
-------

The SCOTT user has already locked the rows by deleting them
without issuing COMMIT or ROLLBACK.
Therefore WIPRO cannot modify the same rows until the lock
is released.


